 "<a href=\"#cite\">Citation</a>": "<a href=\"#cite\">引用</a>",
 "TL;DR": "概要",
 "A video world model generates a world you can move through. Moving means things leave the frame and come back into it. A model that only produces good frames can still forget a person’s face, swap an object, rearrange a room, or freeze an event that should have kept going while the camera looked away.": "视频世界模型生成的是一个可以在里面走动的世界，而走动就意味着东西会移出画面，之后再移回来。只会生成好画面的模型，照样可能忘了人的长相、把物体换掉、把房间重新摆一遍，或者在镜头转开时让本该继续的事件停住。",
 "WorldMemBench tests this directly. In 260 cases across 23 categories, the camera follows a controlled path away from something it has seen and back, once or several times. <strong>Static content</strong>, people, objects and scenes, is compared at every return against the same reference from the start. <strong>Dynamic events</strong>, such as pages being turned or ice melting, are checked with case-specific questions about whether they progressed while out of view. Video quality and camera-following accuracy are reported alongside, so that memory scores can be read in context.": "WorldMemBench 直接测这一点。基准共 260 个样例、23 个类别，相机沿受控路径离开已经看过的内容，再转回来，一次或多次。<strong>静态内容</strong>（人物、物体、场景）每次返回都和开头的同一份参考比对。<strong>动态事件</strong>（如翻书、冰块融化）则用按样例设计的问题，检查它在画面外时有没有继续推进。视频质量和相机跟随精度也一并给出，方便对照着看记忆分数。",
 "<strong>Across nine recent world models, the one that remembers static content best, HY-WorldPlay, starts only 31.7% of the events it is asked to show; and every model forgets more with each return.</strong> No model leads on all four dimensions.": "<strong>九个近期世界模型里，静态记忆最好的 HY-WorldPlay，在要求它呈现的事件中只有 31.7% 真正开始发生；而且所有模型返回次数越多，忘得越多。</strong>没有哪个模型在四个维度上都领先。",
 "<a class=\"card\" href=\"#results\"><p class=\"card-k\">Static memory vs dynamic memory</p><p class=\"card-t\">Remembering is not evolving</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"0\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#revisits\"><p class=\"card-k\">Nine-model average, first to third return</p><p class=\"card-t\">Every return forgets a bit more</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"1\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#context\"><p class=\"card-k\">LingBot World v2, static memory (mean of seven metrics)</p><p class=\"card-t\">Choosing what to remember helps</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"2\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#trust\"><p class=\"card-k\">Agreement with blinded human judgments</p><p class=\"card-t\">The metrics match people</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"3\"></div></a>": "<a class=\"card\" href=\"#results\"><p class=\"card-k\">静态记忆与动态记忆</p><p class=\"card-t\">记住和演化是两回事</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"0\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#revisits\"><p class=\"card-k\">九个模型平均，第一次到第三次返回</p><p class=\"card-t\">每返回一次，就多忘一点</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"1\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#context\"><p class=\"card-k\">LingBot World v2，静态记忆（七项指标均值）</p><p class=\"card-t\">有选择地记，效果更好</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"2\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#trust\"><p class=\"card-k\">与人工盲评的一致率</p><p class=\"card-t\">指标与人的判断吻合</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"3\"></div></a>",
 "<span class=\"n\">1</span>What world memory is": "<span class=\"n\">1</span>什么是世界记忆",
 "Autoregressive video generation has become long and stable enough, and camera and action control precise enough, that “video world models” now let you explore a generated place for tens of seconds. Exploration constantly moves content in and out of view. We call <strong>world memory</strong> the ability to keep what has been established, and to keep it evolving coherently, across those interruptions.": "自回归视频生成已经能做得足够长、足够稳定，相机和动作控制也足够精确，“视频世界模型”如今可以让人在生成的场景里探索几十秒。探索时，内容不断进出视野。我们所说的<strong>世界记忆</strong>，是指在这些中断前后，既能保住已经确立的内容，又能让它连贯地继续演化。",
 "It has two halves. <strong>Static memory</strong>: a person’s identity and clothes, an object’s look and shape, a room’s layout and depth should all be the same when you look again. <strong>Dynamic memory</strong>: something that was happening should have continued while you looked away, and its consequences should be visible when you return. Frame-level quality and local smoothness say nothing about either.": "世界记忆分两部分。<strong>静态记忆</strong>：人的身份和衣着、物体的外观和形状、房间的布局和深度，再看一眼时都应该没变。<strong>动态记忆</strong>：正在发生的事，在视线移开时也应该继续，回来时能看到它造成的结果。帧级画质和局部平滑度对这两点都说明不了什么。",
 "Earlier benchmarks examine pieces of this, such as revisit consistency, or state evolution while unobserved, and one recent benchmark tests recall across repeated loops. WorldMemBench puts them together: long revisits, repeated revisits, state evolution and physical consistency, with camera control and video quality measured in the same rollouts.": "已有的评测基准各自考察其中一部分，比如回访一致性，或者未被观察时的状态演化；最近也有基准测试多次循环后的回忆能力。WorldMemBench 把这些放到一起：长间隔回访、重复回访、状态演化和物理一致性，并在同一批 rollout 上同时测量相机控制和视频质量。",
 "<span class=\"n\">2</span>Leave, and come back": "<span class=\"n\">2</span>离开，再回来",
 "Every case starts from a conditioning frame, the initial view <span class=\"mi\">V</span>. The camera then follows a prescribed path that takes it away and brings it back: a departure <span class=\"mi\">D<sub>i</sub></span> followed by a revisit <span class=\"mi\">R<sub>i</sub></span>. Rotations keep the camera in place and turn it left and right (yaw) or up and down (pitch); translations keep its heading and walk a square. <a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-1\">Figure 1</a> plays real rollouts from the benchmark, all generated by LingBot World v2.": "每个样例的起点是一帧条件帧，即初始视图 <span class=\"mi\">V</span>。随后相机按预设路径离开再返回：离开 <span class=\"mi\">D<sub>i</sub></span> 之后接回访 <span class=\"mi\">R<sub>i</sub></span>。旋转时相机原地不动，左右转（yaw）或上下转（pitch）；平移时相机朝向不变，沿正方形走一圈。<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-1\">图 1</a> 播放的是基准中的真实 rollout，全部由 LingBot World v2 生成。",
 "<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewbox=\"0 0 12 12\"><rect fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"9\" rx=\".6\" width=\"2.6\" x=\"2\" y=\"1.5\"></rect><rect fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"9\" rx=\".6\" width=\"2.6\" x=\"7.4\" y=\"1.5\"></rect></svg><span>Pause</span>": "<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewbox=\"0 0 12 12\"><rect fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"9\" rx=\".6\" width=\"2.6\" x=\"2\" y=\"1.5\"></rect><rect fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"9\" rx=\".6\" width=\"2.6\" x=\"7.4\" y=\"1.5\"></rect></svg><span>暂停</span>",
 "Loading the rollout…": "正在加载 rollout…",
 "<b>Figure 1.</b> The departure-and-revisit protocol on one street scene (environment case 010, generated by LingBot World v2). <b>LRLRLR</b>: the camera stays in place and turns 80° left and back three times (1° per frame, 80 frames per turn), returning at frames 160, 320 and 480. <b>LRLR</b>: two 90° turns (0.75° per frame, 120 frames per turn). <b>LRUD</b>: a 90° left–right cycle, then a 90° up–down cycle, so the second return comes along a new axis. <b>Translation</b> (a different case): the camera keeps its heading and walks forward, right, back and left around a square; the dot’s position is approximate. Each return is scored against the same initial view <span class=\"mi\">V</span>; the thumbnails fill in as the video reaches each return.": "<b>图 1</b> 在一个街景上演示“离开—回访”流程（环境类 010 号样例，由 LingBot World v2 生成）。<b>LRLRLR</b>：相机原地向左转 80° 再转回，重复三次（每帧 1°，每次转动 80 帧），分别在第 160、320、480 帧回到原位。<b>LRLR</b>：两次 90° 转动（每帧 0.75°，每次 120 帧）。<b>LRUD</b>：先左右转 90° 一个来回，再上下转 90° 一个来回，所以第二次是沿新的轴返回。<b>平移</b>（另一个样例）：相机朝向不变，依次向前、向右、向后、向左绕正方形走一圈；圆点位置为近似值。每次返回都和同一个初始视图 <span class=\"mi\">V</span> 比对；视频播到每次返回时，对应的缩略图会补上。",
 "260 cases, 23 categories": "260 个样例，23 个类别",
 "The benchmark has 60 Human, 70 Object and 70 Environment cases, which form the 200-case static-memory set, and 60 Dynamic cases covering seven kinds of state change: motion, assembly, removal, deformation, transfer, reaction and thermal change. Video quality is measured on all 200 static rollouts, and camera following on 85 of them whose trajectories suit pose estimation.": "基准包含 60 个人物、70 个物体和 70 个环境样例，共 200 个，构成静态记忆部分；另有 60 个动态样例，涵盖七类状态变化：运动、组装、移除、形变、转移、反应和热变化。视频质量在全部 200 段静态 rollout 上测量，相机跟随则在其中轨迹适合做位姿估计的 85 段上测量。",
 "Composition": "构成",
 "Four families, 23 categories": "四个大类，23 个类别",
 "<b>Figure 2.</b> Case families and their categories (paper Figure 2). Hover a block for its family.": "<b>图 2</b> 各大类及其下属类别（论文图 2）。鼠标悬停在色块上可查看所属大类。",
 "Scoring what stays": "静态内容怎么评分",
 "For static content, each revisit is compared with a <strong>fixed reference</strong> from the initial view, never with the previous return, so that errors cannot hide by drifting slowly. Scores are averaged over revisits and then over targets, and a prescribed revisit with no valid observation counts as zero.": "对静态内容，每次回访都和初始视图中的<strong>固定参考</strong>比较，而不是和上一次返回比较，这样误差就没法靠缓慢漂移藏起来。分数先在各次回访间平均，再在各目标间平均；预定的回访如果没有有效观测，记为零分。",
 "<strong>People</strong>: identity from ArcFace face embeddings, and appearance from DINOv2 features inside the person’s mask.": "<strong>人物</strong>：身份用 ArcFace 人脸嵌入衡量，外观用人物掩码内的 DINOv2 特征衡量。",
 "<strong>Objects</strong>: the target is found again at each return by detection and video segmentation; appearance from DINOv2 features in the mask, and geometry as the IoU of the silhouettes after normalizing position and scale.": "<strong>物体</strong>：每次返回时通过检测和视频分割重新找到目标；外观用掩码内的 DINOv2 特征衡量，几何用位置和尺度归一化后两个轮廓的 IoU 衡量。",
 "<strong>Environments</strong>: visible content from global DINOv2 features at the return frame whose camera orientation is closest to the start; relative depth order as the Spearman correlation of depth maps; and 3D structure by projecting both depth maps onto a shared spherical grid and comparing the reconstructed surfaces.": "<strong>环境</strong>：可见内容取相机朝向最接近起始朝向的那一帧返回画面，用全局 DINOv2 特征比较；相对深度顺序用两张深度图的 Spearman 相关系数衡量；3D 结构则把两张深度图投影到同一个球面网格上，比较重建出的表面。",
 "Scoring what changes": "动态事件怎么评分",
 "A dynamic event cannot be scored by similarity to the first frame, because the right answer is a different frame. Each dynamic case instead specifies an initial state, an action and the expected next state. A vision-language model (Qwen3.8-27B) first decides whether the event visibly starts at all; if it does not, the case scores zero. Otherwise it answers eight yes/no questions with fixed reference answers, two each on return progress, persistence, final state and causal or physical consistency. <a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-3\">Figure 3</a> shows a real case.": "动态事件不能按与首帧的相似度打分，因为正确答案本来就是另一帧。所以每个动态样例都给定初始状态、动作和预期的下一状态。先由视觉语言模型（Qwen3.8-27B）判断事件在画面中有没有真正开始；没有开始，该样例记零分。开始了，模型再回答八个是/否问题，每题都有固定的参考答案：返回时的进展、状态保持、最终状态、因果或物理一致性各两题。<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-3\">图 3</a> 是一个真实样例。",
 "hold": "静止",
 "<b>Figure 3.</b> A dynamic case (case 023, generated by LingBot World v2): a hand turns the pages of a book. The camera holds, turns 60° away, holds while the pages should keep turning off-screen, turns back, and holds on the result. The eight checklist questions and their reference answers are the case’s released checklist; each lights up when the part of the video it is judged on is playing.": "<b>图 3</b> 一个动态样例（023 号样例，由 LingBot World v2 生成）：一只手在翻书。相机先静止，再转开 60°，停住一段时间（这期间书页应在画面外继续翻动），然后转回来，停在结果上。八个检查问题及其参考答案取自该样例公开的检查清单；视频播到某个问题所依据的片段时，该问题会高亮。",
 "<span class=\"n\">3</span>Nine models, four dimensions": "<span class=\"n\">3</span>九个模型，四个维度",
 "We evaluate HY-WorldPlay, Matrix-Game 3 and 3.5, SANA-WM, YUME, LingBot World and LingBot World v2, Evoke and DreamX World, each with the defaults of its official release and fixed seeds, converting the benchmark trajectories into each model’s own control format.": "我们评测了 HY-WorldPlay、Matrix-Game 3 和 3.5、SANA-WM、YUME、LingBot World 和 LingBot World v2、Evoke 以及 DreamX World。每个模型都使用官方发布版本的默认设置和固定随机种子，基准轨迹则转换成各模型自己的控制格式。",
 "WorldMemBench, nine models": "WorldMemBench，九个模型",
 "All metrics, coloured by rank within each metric": "全部指标，按每项指标内的排名着色",
 "<b>Figure 4.</b> Full results (paper Table 2). Darker means better within a row; for the two camera errors (↓), lower is better. Hover a cell for its rank.": "<b>图 4</b> 完整结果（论文表 2）。同一行中颜色越深越好；两项相机误差（↓）越低越好。鼠标悬停在单元格上可查看排名。",
 "<strong>Static and dynamic memory are different skills.</strong> HY-WorldPlay leads all seven static-memory metrics, from human identity (0.828) to environment reconstruction (0.619), yet its dynamic-memory score is 0.294: it starts only 31.7% of the prescribed events. LingBot World (0.808) and YUME (0.775) lead dynamic memory while sitting in the middle on static metrics. No model leads on both: keeping the world unchanged and keeping it moving pull in different directions (<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-5\">Figure 5</a>).": "<strong>静态记忆和动态记忆是两种不同的能力。</strong>HY-WorldPlay 在全部七项静态记忆指标上领先，从人物身份（0.828）到环境重建（0.619），但动态记忆得分只有 0.294：指定的事件里，它只让 31.7% 真正开始。动态记忆领先的是 LingBot World（0.808）和 YUME（0.775），而它们的静态指标处在中游。没有模型两边都领先：让世界保持不变和让世界继续变化，两者彼此拉扯（<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-5\">图 5</a>）。",
 "Each point is a model": "每个点代表一个模型",
 "Static memory (mean of seven metrics) against dynamic memory": "静态记忆（七项指标均值）与动态记忆",
 "<b>Figure 5.</b> The horizontal axis is our average of the seven static-memory metrics in Table 2; the vertical axis is the Dynamic Memory Overall score. Point size is the imaging-quality score.": "<b>图 5</b> 横轴是我们对表 2 中七项静态记忆指标取的平均，纵轴是动态记忆总分（Dynamic Memory Overall）。点的大小表示成像质量得分。",
 "Camera following varies independently: Matrix-Game 3 has the lowest translation error (0.424) and HY-WorldPlay the lowest rotation error (0.417), and DreamX World, with the highest of both, also has the lowest environment depth and reconstruction scores. Video quality, meanwhile, varies far less across models than memory does, and says little about it.": "相机跟随的排名又是另一回事：Matrix-Game 3 平移误差最低（0.424），HY-WorldPlay 旋转误差最低（0.417）；DreamX World 两项误差都最高，环境深度和重建得分也最低。相比之下，视频质量在模型之间的差异远小于记忆，也很难反映记忆的好坏。",
 "<span class=\"n\">4</span>Memory fades with every return": "<span class=\"n\">4</span>记忆随返回次数衰退",
 "A good first return shows that a model can recover a view once. It does not show that the recovery lasts. Under LRLRLR, the nine-model average falls from the first to the third return on all seven static metrics: object appearance by 0.229, human identity by 0.217, object geometry by 0.205 and environment reconstruction by 0.196. Per model, every one is worse at the third return than the first on the human, object, visible and reconstruction metrics.": "第一次返回表现好，只说明模型能把视角恢复一次，不说明这种恢复能持续。在 LRLRLR 轨迹下，九个模型的平均分从第一次到第三次返回，七项静态指标全部下降：物体外观降 0.229，人物身份降 0.217，物体几何降 0.205，环境重建降 0.196。逐个模型看，在人物、物体、可见内容和重建指标上，每个模型第三次返回都比第一次差。",
 "Two things compound. The returning viewpoint drifts: mean rotation error grows from 0.430 to 0.502 to 0.530 over the three returns. And every model generates autoregressively, so early errors feed later frames. The decline survives restricting the analysis to the 431 environment rollouts whose departures and returns meet the pose criteria: visible content, depth order and reconstruction still fall by 0.152, 0.135 and 0.139.": "这里有两个因素叠加。一是返回时的视角会漂移：三次返回的平均旋转误差从 0.430 升到 0.502，再到 0.530。二是所有模型都是自回归生成，早期误差会带进后面的帧。只保留离开和返回都满足位姿标准的 431 段环境 rollout 再做分析，下降依然存在：可见内容、深度顺序和重建分别下降 0.152、0.135 和 0.139。",
 "One environment case, all nine models": "同一个环境样例，全部九个模型",
 "Visible memory at each return": "每次返回时的可见内容记忆",
 "<b>Figure 6.</b> Scores at the first, second and third return for one environment case (paper Figure 4). Hover a line to pick out a model. HY-WorldPlay and Evoke hold their scene; others lose it, sometimes abruptly.": "<b>图 6</b> 一个环境样例在第一、二、三次返回时的得分（论文图 4）。鼠标悬停在折线上可单独查看某个模型。HY-WorldPlay 和 Evoke 能守住场景，其余模型会把场景丢掉，有时是突然丢掉。",
 "<strong>Changing direction is harder still.</strong> LRLR and LRUD share their first return but differ in the second: LRLR turns left and right again, LRUD pitches up and down. Returning along a new axis costs more for every static metric on average, and for 50 of the 63 model–metric pairs; environment visible memory drops an extra 0.152.": "<strong>换个方向返回更难。</strong>LRLR 和 LRUD 的第一次返回相同，第二次不同：LRLR 再左右转一次，LRUD 改成上下转。沿新的轴返回时，按平均值看每项静态指标都下降得更多，逐个看 63 个模型–指标组合中有 50 个如此；环境可见内容记忆额外下降 0.152。",
 "<span class=\"n\">5</span>What to keep in context": "<span class=\"n\">5</span>上下文里该保留什么",
 "Because the benchmark separates dimensions, it can be used to diagnose design choices. Holding LingBot World v2 and all generation settings fixed, we compared three training-free ways of choosing which past frames the model attends to: the <strong>full history</strong> (FullKV), only the <strong>recent window</strong> (Sliding), and recent frames plus <strong>view-relevant history</strong> retrieved by field of view (FoV), the last two under the same budget.": "评测基准把各个维度分开，因此可以用来诊断设计选择。我们固定 LingBot World v2 和全部生成设置，比较三种无需训练的做法，它们决定模型关注哪些历史帧：<strong>全部历史</strong>（FullKV）；只保留<strong>最近窗口</strong>（Sliding）；最近帧加上按视场检索出的<strong>视角相关历史</strong>（FoV）。后两种使用相同的预算。",
 "LingBot World v2, model and settings fixed": "LingBot World v2，模型与设置固定",
 "Memory scores under three context policies": "三种上下文策略下的记忆得分",
 "<b>Figure 7.</b> Eleven memory metrics and end-to-end latency over 660 matched videos (paper Table 3). FoV is best on eight of eleven metrics and beats Sliding on all eleven.": "<b>图 7</b> 在 660 段配对视频上的十一项记忆指标和端到端延迟（论文表 3）。FoV 在十一项指标中有八项最好，且十一项全部优于 Sliding。",
 "FoV beats the full history on all four dynamic sub-metrics and both human metrics, while full history keeps an edge on object appearance, object geometry and visible environment content. Both budgeted policies are faster: 262.7 and 260.4 seconds per video against 322.2 for full history, about 1.23× and 1.24×. Mixing recent context with view-relevant history looks like a good trade, and the benchmark shows which kinds of memory each choice helps.": "FoV 在四项动态子指标和两项人物指标上都优于全部历史，全部历史则在物体外观、物体几何和环境可见内容上仍有优势。两种有预算的策略都更快：每段视频分别耗时 262.7 秒和 260.4 秒，全部历史为 322.2 秒，速度约为它的 1.23 倍和 1.24 倍。把最近上下文和视角相关历史结合起来，看起来是不错的折中；这个基准还能显示每种选择帮到的是哪类记忆。",
 "<span class=\"n\">6</span>Do the scores agree with people?": "<span class=\"n\">6</span>自动评分和人的判断一致吗？",
 "For static memory, three annotators judged 504 blinded pairs of rollouts. The automatic metrics agree with the human majority on 78.5% to 92.5% of decisive pairs, and model rankings correlate with human win rates up to ρ = 0.988 for visible environment memory. For dynamic memory, three annotators answered all 400 checklist items of 50 cases; the VLM judge’s overall scores correlate with theirs at Spearman ρ = 0.732 (PLCC 0.808). Causal and physical questions are the hardest to judge, at ρ = 0.401.": "静态记忆方面，三名标注者对 504 对 rollout 做了盲评。在分出胜负的样本对上，自动指标与多数人判断的一致率为 78.5% 到 92.5%；模型排名与人工胜率的相关性最高达到 ρ = 0.988（环境可见内容记忆）。动态记忆方面，三名标注者回答了 50 个样例的全部 400 道检查题；VLM 评判给出的总分与人工总分的 Spearman ρ 为 0.732（PLCC 0.808）。因果与物理类问题最难判断，ρ 为 0.401。",
 "Static metric": "静态指标",
 "Agreement with human majority": "与人工多数意见的一致率",
 "Model-level Spearman ρ": "模型级 Spearman ρ",
 "Environment visible": "环境可见内容",
 "Human appearance": "人物外观",
