 "Inference settings for every model, the dynamic-memory prompts and the full per-trajectory results are in the <a class=\"tx\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.19063\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">paper</a>; rollouts, scores and the evaluation code are on <a class=\"tx\" href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/rescuerz/WorldMemBench\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Hugging Face</a> and <a class=\"tx\" href=\"https://github.com/ZJU-REAL/WorldMemBench\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub</a>.": "各模型的推理设置、动态记忆提示词和逐条轨迹的完整结果见<a class=\"tx\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.19063\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">论文</a>；rollout、评分和评测代码已发布在 <a class=\"tx\" href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/rescuerz/WorldMemBench\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Hugging Face</a> 和 <a class=\"tx\" href=\"https://github.com/ZJU-REAL/WorldMemBench\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub</a>。",
